      <description>United in Sport This summer, U.S. athletes will compete for glory on the world's stage in France. Women’s wrestling superstar Helen Maroulis, with a gold medal in 2016 and a bronze in 2020, stands as a seasoned champion. Rising soccer star Cade Cowell, on the other hand, is poised to make his mark in France this summer. Despite the differences in their sports – wrestling and soccer – Helen and Cade are united by a passion for competition, love of country, and a focused approach to fueling perfor</description>
