      <description>Fueling Champions Join us on an incredible journey with Chef Teren Green, the renowned chef behind the U.S. Women's National Team's success in the 2019 World Cup. From France to fueling champions, Chef T's story is one of passion, teamwork, and creating protein-rich recipes for athletes. Discover the integral role Chef Teren Green played as the team's chef, how peanuts take center stage in his recipes for athletes, and explore his culinary philosophy focused on clean, nutrient-dense ingredients.</description>
